fer_header":{"type":"text","value":"Assured Savings upto Rs 200 "},"offer_details":{"type":"text","value":"Get upto Rs 200 + Earn upto 16X rewards"},"offer_date":{"type":"text","value":"2024-08-31"},"mov":{"type":"text","value":"499"},"user_eligibility":{"type":"text","value":"User should be enrolled on any loyalty program on Pay with Rewards"},"reward":{"type":"text","value":"Upto Rs 200 Savings + upto 16X rewards"},"coupon_code":{"type":"text","value":""},"department_option":{"type":"select","value":"others"},"logo":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1711980417221.png"},"det_logo":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1711980417222.png"},"banner":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1720760179397.png"},"coupon_card_cta":{"type":"select","value":"shopnow"},"cta_redirection_link":{"type":"text","value":"\u002F"},"how_do_you_get_it":{"type":"text","value":"Pay via \u003Ci\u003EPay with Rewards\u003C\u002Fi\u003E on Netmeds using code inside \u003Ci\u003EPay with Rewards.\u003C\u002Fi\u003E New users get savings of max Rs 200, auto credited in \u003Ci\u003EPay with Rewards\u003C\u002Fi\u003E within 7 days of transaction. All users get upto 16X Rewards using Flipkart (Max Points 150)"},"cancellation_conditions":{"type":"text","value":"If the order gets cancelled the reward points or the cashback will be withdrawn"},"tnc":{"type":"text","value":"OFFER INCLUDES:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Under this offer, till 31st August 2024, NEW users, who make transactions using ‘Pay with Rewards’ payment option at Netmeds.com\u002FApp\u002FM-site, are entitled to receive assured Savings of up to Rs. 200, towards an order of ANY products worth a minimum of Rs. 499 or more, PLUS earn Up to 16X Rewards on ALL transactions worth ANY value placed on Netmeds via ‘Pay with Rewards’ by using the issuer, Flipkart (max. reward points: 150) by applying the coupon code inside Pay with Rewards. \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E ELIGIBILTY: \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E (i) Assured savings of up to Rs. 200: The Savings offer can be availed only ONCE per user during the offer period. This offer is valid for NEW users, who make transactions worth a minimum of Rs. 499 on Netmeds by applying the coupon code inside Pay with Rewards. \u003Cbr\u003E (ii) Up to 16X Rewards: Also, NEW users, who make the payment using Pay with Rewards payment option on Netmeds by using Flipkart, are entitled to receive Up to 16X Rewards on any number of transactions worth ANY value made during the offer period.\u003Cbr\u003E Assured savings of up to Rs. 200 and Up to 16X Rewards are applicable for NEW users who transact on Netmeds using the coupon code inside Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E This offer is NOT applicable for the customers who are not enrolled on any of the associated loyalty programs on Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E This offer is valid ONLY on transactions made on Netmeds.com\u002FApp\u002FM-site.\u003Cbr\u003E Savings is valid for 15 days post its issuance\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E NOTE:\u003Cbr\u003E As a part of this offer, the maximum savings amount is capped at Rs. 200, per customer.\u003Cbr\u003E The maximum reward points for transactions via Flipkart is capped at 150.\u003Cbr\u003E Customers can either apply the previously issued savings coupon and get the applicable discount OR choose to avail assured savings of up to Rs. 200, under this offer, by making an eligible transaction.\u003Cbr\u003E To avail assured savings of up to Rs. 200 or to earn up to 16X Rewards, only one coupon code can be applied in a transaction. NOTE: In a transaction where the saving is being availed by redeeming a previously issued savings coupon, a new savings coupon cannot be issued.\u003Cbr\u003E To avail the Savings offer or Up to 16X Rewards, you MUST apply the Coupon code inside Pay with Rewards. The Coupon code can be found in the coupon section of Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E The assured savings of up to Rs. 200 will be autocredited in Pay with Rewards within 7 days from the date of transaction for New users.\u003Cbr\u003E A minimum order value of Rs. 499 is required to avail assured savings of up to Rs. 200, BUT No minimum order value is required to get Up to 16X Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E Please Note: This offer is applicable on the purchase of ANY products OR the booking of online Doctor Consultation\u002FLab Tests made on Netmeds.com\u002FApp\u002FM-site only.\u003Cbr\u003E Saving is valid for 15 days post its issuance \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E  OTHER TERMS AND CONDITIONS\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E It should be noted that Netmeds is in no way responsible for the savings amount or reward points received by a customer under this offer.\u003Cbr\u003E If your order is cancelled or not delivered, the savings amount or the reward points that have been credited in Pay with Rewards will be withdrawn.\u003Cbr\u003E This offer cannot be combined with any other payment partner offers on Netmeds. Netmeds.com will not be liable for any issues or disputes arising out of this offer conducted by Twidpay.\u003Cbr\u003E Netmeds.com and Twid reserve the right to withdraw, modify or replace this offer with another offer at any time without prior notice and the same is at the sole discretion of the company.\u003Cbr\u003E By availing this offer, it is deemed that the customer has agreed to all the terms & conditions mentioned herein.\u003Cbr\u003E Saving is valid for 15 days post its issuance"},"overall_eligibility_det":{"type":"text","value":"This offer is NOT applicable for the customers who are not enrolled on any of the associated loyalty programs on Pay with Rewards. This offer is valid on the purchase of products OR booking of online Doctor Consultation\u002FLab Tests."},"rank":{"type":"text","value":"4"},"status":{"type":"checkbox","value":true}},"predicate":{"schedule":{"start":"","end":"","cron":""},"zones":[]},"expand":true},{"type":"gallery_image","name":"Coupon card","props":{"offer_header":{"type":"text","value":"Get upto Rs 35 Freecharge UPI Cashback"},"offer_details":{"type":"text","value":" On a minimum purchase of ANY products* worth Rs 999, get Freecharge UPI Cashback upto Rs 35"},"offer_date":{"type":"text","value":"2024-08-31"},"mov":{"type":"text","value":"999"},"user_eligibility":{"type":"text","value":"All Customers"},"reward":{"type":"text","value":"Freecharge UPI Cashback upto Rs. 35 on purchase of ANY products* worth Rs. 999"},"coupon_code":{"type":"text","value":""},"department_option":{"type":"select"},"logo":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1720759830801.png"},"det_logo":{"type":"image_picker"},"banner":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1720759730930.png"},"coupon_card_cta":{"type":"select","value":"shopnow"},"cta_redirection_link":{"type":"text","value":"\u002F"},"how_do_you_get_it":{"type":"text","value":"To avail this offer, the customer needs to undertake a successful transaction at Netmeds using Freecharge UPI collect by selecting UPI option on Netmeds app. Cashback of Rs. 35 will only be credited when the amount is paid using Freecharge UPI collect. Cashback will be credited in the form of scratch cards within 72 (seventy two) hours from the date of transaction"},"cancellation_conditions":{"type":"text","value":"If the order is cancelled or not delivered, the Freecharge UPI cashback will be withdrawn."},"tnc":{"type":"text","value":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cb\u003E1. OFFER:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Under this offer, ALL users, who place an order by using the Freecharge UPI option on Netmeds.com\u002FNetmeds App, are entitled to receive assured cashback of up to Rs. 35, on the purchase of ANY* products\u002Fonline Doctor Consultation worth a minimum of Rs. 999. Offer is valid Once per user during the campaign validity.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E  \u003Cp\u003E \u003Cb\u003E2. OFFER PERIOD:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Untill 31st August, 2024\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E  \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cb\u003E3. OFFER ELIGIBILITY:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - Get upto Rs.35 cashback on min. txn. value of INR. 999 on Netmeds using Freecharge UPI; Offer is vaid Once Per User during the offer period\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - Cashback will only be credited when the amount is paid using Freecharge UPI collect\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - Cashback will be credited in the form of scratch cards within 72 (seventy two) hours from the date of transaction\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - To avail this offer, the customer needs to undertake a successful transaction at Netmeds using Freecharge UPI collect by selecting UPI option on Netmeds app\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - This offer is not applicable on Netmeds app transactions via Freecharge wallet\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - This offer is only applicable on doing the transaction through Freecharge UPI.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003Cb\u003E4. OTHER TERMS AND CONDITIONS\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - If the order is cancelled or not delivered, the Freecharge UPI cashback will be withdrawn.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - Netmeds.com will not be liable for any issues or disputes arising out of the Freecharge UPI offer. \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - Netmeds.com and Freecharge UPI reserve the absolute right to withdraw, modify or replace this offer with another offer at any time without prior notice and the same is at the sole discretion of the company.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E - By availing this offer, it is deemed that the customer has agreed to all the terms &amp; conditions mentioned herein.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E"},"overall_eligibility_det":{"type":"text","value":"Offer is applicable only when you pay on Netmeds for Rs. 999 or more through Freecharge UPI for all customers valid only ONCE per user during the offer period. Offer valid ONLY on transactions made via the Freecharge UPI on Netmeds website\u002Fapp. *Offer valid on purchase of ANY products\u002Fonline Doctor Consultation and booking of lab tests."},"rank":{"type":"text","value":"3"},"status":{"type":"checkbox","value":true}}},{"type":"gallery_image","name":"Coupon card","props":{"offer_header":{"type":"text","value":"Assured Savings upto Rs 150"},"offer_details":{"type":"text","value":"Get upto Rs 150 + Earn upto 16X rewards"},"offer_date":{"type":"text","value":"2024-08-31"},"mov":{"type":"text","value":"999"},"user_eligibility":{"type":"text","value":"User should be enrolled on any loyalty program on Pay with Rewards"},"reward":{"type":"text","value":"Upto Rs 150 Savings + upto 16X rewards"},"coupon_code":{"type":"text","value":""},"department_option":{"type":"select"},"logo":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1712753626195.png"},"det_logo":{"type":"image_picker"},"banner":{"type":"image_picker","value":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.pixelbin.io\u002Fv2\u002Fplain-cake-860195\u002Fnetmed\u002Fwrkr\u002Fnmz\u002Fcompany\u002F2\u002Fapplications\u002F65f562c1504a59a67f529ad4\u002Ftheme\u002Fpictures\u002Ffree\u002Foriginal\u002Ftheme-image-1720760817102.png"},"coupon_card_cta":{"type":"select","value":"shopnow"},"cta_redirection_link":{"type":"text","value":"\u002F"},"how_do_you_get_it":{"type":"text","value":"Pay via Pay with Rewards on Netmeds using code inside Pay with Rewards. ALL users get assured savings of max Rs 150, auto credited in Pay with Rewards within 7 days of transaction. ALL users also get Upto 16X Rewards using Flipkart (max. points 150)"},"cancellation_conditions":{"type":"text","value":"If your order is cancelled or not delivered, the savings or the reward points that have been credited in Pay with Rewards will be withdrawn."},"tnc":{"type":"text","value":"\u003Cb\u003EOFFER INCLUDES:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Under this Offer, till 31st August 2024, ALL users, who make transactions using ‘Pay with Rewards’ payment option at Netmeds.com\u002FApp\u002FM-site, are entitled to receive assured Savings of up to Rs. 150, towards an order of ANY products worth a minimum of Rs. 999 or more, PLUS earn Up to 16X Rewards on ALL transactions worth ANY value placed on Netmeds via ‘Pay with Rewards’ by using the issuer, Flipkart (max. reward points: 150) by applying the coupon code inside Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003Cb\u003EELIGIBILTY:\u003C\u002Fb\u003E \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E (i) Assured savings of up to Rs. 150: The Savings offer can be availed only ONCE per user during the offer period. This offer is valid for NEW users and existing users, who make transactions worth a minimum of Rs. 999 on Netmeds by applying the coupon code inside Pay with Rewards. \u003Cbr\u003E (ii) Up to 16X Rewards: Also, ALL users, who make the payment using Pay with Rewards payment option on Netmeds by using Flipkart, are entitled to receive Up to 16X Rewards on any number of transactions worth ANY value made during the offer period.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Assured savings of up to Rs. 150 and Up to 16X Rewards are applicable for New and existing users who transact on Netmeds using the coupon code inside Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E This offer is NOT applicable for the customers who are not enrolled on any of the associated loyalty programs on Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E This offer is valid ONLY on transactions made on Netmeds.com\u002FApp\u002FM-site.\u003Cbr\u003E Savings is valid for 15 days post its issuance \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E NOTE:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E As a part of this offer, the maximum savings amount is capped at Rs. 150, per customer.\u003Cbr\u003E The maximum reward points for transactions via Flipkart is capped at 150.\u003Cbr\u003E Customers can either apply the previously issued savings coupon and get the applicable discount OR choose to avail assured savings of up to Rs. 150, under this offer, by making an eligible transaction.\u003Cbr\u003E To avail assured savings of up to Rs. 150 or to earn up to 16X Rewards, only one coupon code can be applied in a transaction. NOTE: In a transaction where the saving is being availed by redeeming a previously issued savings coupon, a new savings coupon cannot be issued.\u003Cbr\u003E To avail the Savings offer or Up to 16X Rewards, you MUST apply the Coupon code inside Pay with Rewards. The Coupon code can be found in the coupon section of Pay with Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E  The assured savings of up to Rs. 150 will be autocredited in Pay with Rewards within 7 days from the date of transaction for New and existing users.\u003Cbr\u003E A minimum order value of Rs. 999 is required to avail assured savings of up to Rs. 150, BUT No minimum order value is required to get Up to 16X Rewards.\u003Cbr\u003E Please Note: This offer is applicable on the purchase of ANY products OR the booking of online Doctor Consultation\u002FLab Tests made on Netmeds.com\u002FApp\u002FM-site only.\u003Cbr\u003E Saving is valid for 15 days post its issuance \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003Cb\u003EOTHER TERMS AND CONDITIONS\u003C\u002Fb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E It should be noted that Netmeds is in no way responsible for the savings amount or reward points received by a customer under this offer.\u003Cbr\u003E If your order is cancelled or not delivered, the savings amount or the reward points that have been credited in Pay with Rewards will be withdrawn.\u003Cbr\u003E This offer cannot be combined with any other payment partner offers on Netmeds.\u003Cbr\u003E Netmeds.com will not be liable for any issues or disputes arising out of this offer conducted by Twidpay.\u003Cbr\u003E Netmeds.com and Twid reserve the right to withdraw, modify or replace this offer with another offer at any time without prior notice and the same is at the sole discretion of the company.\u003Cbr\u003E By availing this offer, it is deemed that the customer has agreed to all the terms & conditions mentioned herein.\u003Cbr\u003E Saving is valid for 15 days post its issuance\u003Cbr\u003E"},"overall_eligibility_det":{"type":"text","value":"This offer is NOT applicable for the customers who are not enrolled on any of the associated loyalty programs on Pay with Rewards. This offer is valid on the purchase of products OR booking of online Doctor Consultation\u002FLab Tests."},"rank":{"type":"text","value":"4"},"status":{"type":"checkbox","value":true}}}],"source":"themeBundle","__source":{"id":"","bundle_name":""},"global_reference":"66740913f1beff3c300cb48f","preset":{"blocks":[{"name":"Card 1"},{"name":"Card 2"}]},"predicate":{"screen":{"mobile":true,"desktop":true,"tablet":true},"user":{"authenticated":true,"anonymous":true},"route":{"selected":"none","exact_url":""},"platform":{"ios":true,"android":true,"web":true},"sched